  "figure_captions": {
    "fig01_dynamic_availability.png": "Figure 1. Replayed monthly area-weighted availability for every dynamic field written to the frozen coastal-node cube from 1993 through 2025.",
    "fig02_release_and_strict_masks.png": "Figure 2. Mandatory predictor-ready coverage remains separate from five-field strict common support; dashed curves show the shallower and more seasonally incomplete shelf core.",
    "fig03_summary_coverage.png": "Figure 3. Mean and worst-month product-area coverage for each stored field and the two distinct readiness masks, confirming that optional ADT does not gate release.",
    "fig04_adt_seasonality.png": "Figure 4. Calendar-month climatology of ADT and strict support, showing why an ADT requirement would impose a strong seasonal selection on shelf waters.",
    "fig05_status_accounting.png": "Figure 5. Missing, physical-range-rejected, and imputed grid-month accounting; the frozen cube performs no imputation and preserves unavailable values as NaN plus status codes.",
    "fig06_storage_accounting.png": "Figure 6. Storage accounting for the five full-grid standardized caches and the coastal-node cube, which removes land and non-product ocean nodes while retaining explicit status masks.",
    "fig07_replay_checks.png": "Figure 7. Deterministic source-value, status, readiness-mask, and Issue 52 coverage replay mismatches; all required checks must remain exactly zero.",
    "fig08_source_inventory.png": "Figure 8. Frozen input-artifact sizes for the geometry, target cache, split manifest, and five standardized predictor sources; every SHA256 was verified before publication.",
    "fig09_strict_map_1994-02.png": "Figure 9. Exact five-field strict common-support mask for 1994-02; this diagnostic mask is deliberately separate from the mandatory predictor-ready release mask.",
    "fig10_strict_map_2025-12.png": "Figure 10. Exact five-field strict common-support mask for 2025-12; this diagnostic mask is deliberately separate from the mandatory predictor-ready release mask.",
    "fig11_frozen_roles.png": "Figure 11. Frozen production roles distinguish mandatory dynamic inputs, explicitly masked background SSS, optional ADT, and transformations that must be fitted only inside training folds."
